      "When sending to other ${ MAIL_APP_NAME } users, encryption is automatic. Sending to non-${ MAIL_APP_NAME_TWO } users requires setting a password prior to sending.": [
        "Pri slanju drugim ${ MAIL_APP_NAME } korisnicima, šifriranje je automatsko. Slanje korisnicima koji nisu ${ MAIL_APP_NAME_TWO } zahtijeva postavljanje lozinke prije slanja."
